        <mxCell id="c21" value="dev and main run the same workflows. Every push to dev or main deploys pre-production and opens a timestamped promotion PR onto production. The promotion PR is opened by github-actions[bot]; GitHub runs its diff workflow after a user with write access approves the run." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="420" width="1000" height="60" as="geometry" />
